{"seq":2,"slug":"automatic-management","title":"自动内存管理","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/memory-management-models/automatic-management","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"tracing-gc-algorithms","title":"追踪式垃圾回收算法","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/memory-management-models/automatic-management/tracing-gc-algorithms","wordCount":2012,"readingTime":9},{"seq":2,"slug":"reference-counting","title":"引用计数","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/memory-management-models/automatic-management/reference-counting","wordCount":1995,"readingTime":8},{"seq":3,"slug":"generational-concurrent-gc","title":"分代与并发垃圾回收","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/memory-management-models/automatic-management/generational-concurrent-gc","wordCount":1909,"readingTime":8}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"自动内存管理\">自动内存管理</h1><p>本章深入自动内存管理的两大范式：追踪式垃圾回收（Tracing GC）与引用计数（Reference Counting）。从基础算法到现代工业级实现，系统展现 GC 技术四十年的演进脉络。</p>\n<p>三篇文档的组织逻辑：追踪 GC 算法建立「可达性分析」的核心框架，引用计数提供另一条「即时回收」的路径与其固有局限，分代并发 GC 则展示如何将基础算法组合优化到亚毫秒级暂停。</p>\n<p>2026 年的 GC 技术已高度成熟——ZGC 实现了 TB 级堆上的亚毫秒暂停，Shenandoah 完成了分代化改造。理解这些实现的设计权衡，是做出正确技术选型的前提。</p>\n"}